  "docs": "Disable gateway JWT verification, then deploy the Edge Function. Install the [OAuth Consent block](https://supabase.com/library/docs/nextjs/oauth-consent), enable OAuth and dynamic registration, and set the Auth Site URL to the consent app. The block accepts only OAuth user tokens. OAuth scopes do not control data or tool access, so enforce every operation with RLS and use `client_id` for client-specific policies. Review dynamically registered clients and let users revoke grants. See [MCP authentication](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/oauth-server/mcp-authentication) and [token security](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/oauth-server/token-security)."
